Use case: stylized-concept
Asset: ONE approximately 16:9 PNG production monster concept sheet for THE DYING GODS — ACT I. Original design: REDBOUND / BELLWETHER. User anatomy: Cổ dài, lồng ngực có các vòng xương phát nhịp (a long neck, ribcage bearing rhythmic pulsating bone rings).
Anatomy: a hunched long-armed bipedal red-fleshed monster with a conspicuously long upright gently curved neck emerging from the forward-sloping shoulders. Compact narrow head, long drooping arms, small bent legs, splayed grounded feet. The living thorax bears four clearly separated WHITE BONE RINGS encircling the chest horizontally, anatomical external hoops set at intervals around a red fleshy ribcage; each forms a continuous ring around the torso, visible around sides in front and rear views. These are chest rings, not a halo behind the head, no shoulder chimney tubes. Subtle fleshy pink membranes between rings convey rhythmic expansion and contraction, one slightly expanded mid-chest ring and tiny localized soft warm pink tissue under it, no neon, no large magic effects. Keep the majority of skin intact red, no exposed organs. Long neck and encircling pulse rings are the signature silhouette. Not an inflated-throat reptile or previous Ember Throat, not a staff-carrying shaman, not a dragon or bird. No throat pouch, staff, bell, weapons, clothes or unrelated equipment.
Ordered authoritative material palette: Đỏ thẫm / deep dark red DOMINANT; Xương trắng / white bone SECONDARY; Hồng thịt / fleshy pink ACCENT. About 65-75% of BODY surface remains unmistakably deep dark red flesh across neck, head, arms, abdomen, back and legs. Bone limited to chest rings, not a full skeletal torso. Fleshy pink localized to narrow ring membranes and small skin folds. Starting material ratio 65/25/10, not background coverage or exact measured pixel ratio. Keep red readable, not black or uniform grey. These HEX anchors are proposed concept interpretations, NOT user-specified colors: deep red #84232C and lit planes #AA3F47, white bone #D3CDBC, fleshy pink #B97F7C. Matte leathery skin and aged pale bone, neutral-cool light must preserve the reds and pink.
Composition: dominant large full-body elevated game three-quarter view on left, camera looking down about 40 degrees; smaller consistent front, strict side and rear full-body views on right with generous spacing. Same long neck, arm lengths, four chest rings and colors throughout. Keep every head, hand, foot inside frame. No text. Neutral threatening stance makes chest rings readable, no extra monsters, no human reference needed.
Style: grounded semi-realistic dark fantasy, low-to-moderate detail, broad forms and readable game-scale value masses. Soft neutral-cool upper-left lighting, contact shadows only. Plain dark neutral grey background, no scenery or horizon. No text, letters, numbers, logos, labels, watermarks, borders, HUD, gratuitous gore, bloom, rim light, neon or polished modern materials. New user species and palette take priority over all prior batch designs or canonical D2 source colors.


